---
layout: base.njk
pageKey: pricing
title: Pricing
permalink: pricing.html
description: Honest pricing for website redesigns first, with custom apps, chatbots, and automation available when the business needs more. Free scan first, real number second.
---

{# ===== Page head ====================================================== #}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container container--narrow center">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">Pricing</span>
    <h1 class="section__title">Honest pricing. A free scan first, a real number second.</h1>
    <p class="section__lead">
      Agency-grade work at independent-studio prices. We do not quote blind — website work starts
      at $1,490 (small agencies charge $5,000–$9,000 for the same thing), and every lane has a
      clear starting point well below market. The free scan tells us what is worth building first.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Starting points (per-service anchors) ======================== #}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head section__head--center" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">Starting points</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">Where each service usually lands</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        Rough numbers by service. Your exact price always comes from the free scan, never a blind
        guess.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="price-anchors price-anchors--wide" data-reveal>
      {% for lane in site.productLanes %}
        <a class="price-anchor{% if lane.key == 'website' %} price-anchor--feature{% endif %}" href="{{ lane.demoUrl }}">
          <span class="price-anchor__label">{{ lane.shortTitle }}</span>
          <span class="price-anchor__amount">{{ lane.startsAt }}</span>
          {% if lane.compareAt %}<span class="price-anchor__compare">{{ lane.compareAt }}</span>{% endif %}
          <span class="price-anchor__note">{{ lane.bestFor }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="assurances" data-reveal>
      <div class="assurance">
        <strong>7-day website, or it's free</strong>
        <span>Miss the deadline on a Website-in-7-days build and you don't pay.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="assurance">
        <strong>Love the build in 14 days</strong>
        <span>We keep iterating at no extra cost until it's right — no risk on the low price.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="assurance">
        <strong>Only 4 new builds a month</strong>
        <span>A two-founder studio means senior attention on every project, not a queue.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Tiers ========================================================= #}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head section__head--center" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">Project tiers</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">How projects usually come together</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">Most work lands in one of these three shapes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <article class="price" data-reveal>
        <h2 class="price__name">Website start</h2>
        <p class="price__amount">$1.5k+ <small>site or redesign</small></p>
        <span class="price__compare"><s>Agencies: $5k–$9k</s> · you save thousands</span>
        <p class="price__desc">A focused website or redesign scope that makes the business look credible and easier to contact.</p>
        <ul class="price__features">
          <li>New website, landing page, or homepage rebuild</li>
          <li>Mobile cleanup and conversion copy</li>
          <li>Contact, booking, or lead-capture path</li>
          <li>A direct line to the builders</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="price__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--block" href="{{ site.cta.url }}">Start with a free scan</a>
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--block" href="{{ site.checkout.url }}">Open checkout</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="price price--popular" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        <span class="price__flag">Most common</span>
        <h2 class="price__name">Growth website</h2>
        <p class="price__amount">$2.5k-$5.5k</p>
        <span class="price__compare"><s>Agencies: $9k+</s> · best value</span>
        <p class="price__desc">A polished multi-page website with booking, lead capture, proof, and basic follow-up connected.</p>
        <ul class="price__features">
          <li>Multi-page site or landing system</li>
          <li>Booking and lead capture wired in</li>
          <li>Optional chatbot or dashboard lane</li>
          <li>Follow-ups and basic analytics</li>
          <li>Two weeks of tuning after launch</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="price__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--block" href="{{ site.checkout.url }}">Open checkout</a>
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--block" href="{{ site.cta.url }}">Start with a free scan</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="price" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
        <h2 class="price__name">Custom product</h2>
        <p class="price__amount">$1.5k+ <small>quoted</small></p>
        <span class="price__compare"><s>Agencies: $25k+</s> · apps, dashboards, AI</span>
        <p class="price__desc">Custom apps, dashboards, chatbots, AI agents, or a connected system built around your workflow.</p>
        <ul class="price__features">
          <li>Apps, portals, dashboards, or AI systems</li>
          <li>Custom dashboards and internal tools</li>
          <li>Multiple integrations</li>
          <li>AI tools when they actually help the workflow</li>
          <li>An ongoing build partnership</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="price__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--block" href="{{ site.cta.url }}">Book a scope call</a>
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--block" href="{{ site.checkout.url }}">Open checkout</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="note-card mt-7" data-reveal>
      <span class="note-card__tag">How we quote</span>
      <p>
        Every number starts with a free scan. No pressure and no blind invoice. You will get a
        plain-English breakdown of the first build we recommend, the starting lane it belongs to,
        and what it costs before you decide anything. Already know what you need? You can
        <a href="buy.html">buy a fixed-price package</a> or <a href="{{ site.checkout.url }}">open checkout</a> — no call required. After launch, keep it
        running with a <a href="care.html">care plan</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Flagship: Symbio Partner (premium S-tier) ===================== #}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head section__head--center" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">The flagship</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">When you want a team, not a vendor</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        Most clients start with a one-time build. The ones who want to compound results put us on
        retainer — a senior team running the whole growth engine for them.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="partner-band" data-reveal>
      <div class="partner-band__intro">
        <span class="price__flag price__flag--static">Flagship · S-tier</span>
        <h3 class="partner-band__title">{{ site.partnerPlan.name }}</h3>
        <p class="partner-band__amount">{{ site.partnerPlan.price }}<small>{{ site.partnerPlan.cadence }}</small></p>
        <p class="partner-band__compare">{{ site.partnerPlan.compareAt }}</p>
        <p class="partner-band__blurb">{{ site.partnerPlan.blurb }}</p>
        <p class="partner-band__min">{{ site.partnerPlan.minimum }}</p>
        <div class="btn-row mt-6">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--lg" href="{% if site.partnerPlan.checkoutUrl %}{{ site.partnerPlan.checkoutUrl }}{% else %}{{ site.checkout.url }}{% endif %}">Become a Partner</a>
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="{{ site.cta.url }}">Start with a free scan</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="partner-band__features">
        {% for feature in site.partnerPlan.features %}<li>{{ feature }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Closing CTA =================================================== #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="cta-band__title">Get your real number</h2>
      <p class="cta-band__text">
